{"id":"n16454-1-7","stage":3,"title":"상담 · 咨询","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16454-1-7-1","ko":"요즘 두통이 심해져서 괴로워요.","zh":"最近头痛越来越严重，让我很苦恼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"두통이","meaning":"头痛，头疼","explanation":"두통：头痛，头疼；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"두통","audio":"/audio/e77730212cb5613671db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48344","senseId":"1","lemma":"두통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두통이","audio":"/audio/674ba9428388009d480d.mp3"}},{"text":"심해져서","meaning":"严重；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"심하다：严重；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심해져서","audio":"/audio/2c0c7c15dae7966cdd28.mp3"}},{"text":"괴로워요.","meaning":"痛苦，难过","explanation":"괴롭다：痛苦，难过；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괴롭다","audio":"/audio/1197b28135aa8853eb33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30850","senseId":"1","lemma":"괴롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괴로워요","audio":"/audio/0045be2718a77b13110c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"e77730212cb56136","term":"두통","zh":"头痛，头疼","audio":"/audio/e77730212cb5613671db.mp3","entryId":"48344","definition":"头部疼痛的症状。","pronunciation":["두통"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"1197b28135aa8853","term":"괴롭다","zh":"痛苦，难过","audio":"/audio/1197b28135aa8853eb33.mp3","entryId":"30850","definition":"身心不舒服而疼痛难受。","pronunciation":["괴롭따","궤롭따"]}],"audio":"/audio/ffb5f7cc8a42269c03d4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16454-1-7-2","ko":"병원에 가서 상담을 받아 보는 게 어때요?","zh":"去医院咨询一下怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"상담을","meaning":"咨询","explanation":"상담：咨询；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상담","audio":"/audio/22a7c006cd3331bca632.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16454","senseId":"1","lemma":"상담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상담을","audio":"/audio/4529ab06a73ea49ff14a.mp3"}},{"text":"받아","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받아","audio":"/audio/0a0a7a563f5137f6e18d.mp3"}},{"text":"보는","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보는","audio":"/audio/8103e7fed907b17e57e3.mp3"}},{"text":"게","meaning":"这件事、这种情况（것 + 이）","explanation":"게 是依存名词 것 和主格助词 이 的缩合，指前面修饰的事物、行为或情况，并把它作为主语；这里不是表示将来计划的 -ㄹ/을 것이다。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"게","audio":"/audio/c7150cec89b60925ae40.mp3"}},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때요","audio":"/audio/6dbf157a4dc7e6e8b537.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"22a7c006cd3331bc","term":"상담","zh":"咨询","audio":"/audio/22a7c006cd3331bca632.mp3","entryId":"16454","definition":"为解决某个问题而互相交谈。","pronunciation":["상담"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"前面所说的行为、状态或事情","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5f2d05fbcb5c7099d4c1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.857,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16454","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5823,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["最近头痛越来越严重，让我很苦恼。","去医院咨询一下怎么样？","我们家孩子最近根本不听话，真是个问题。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近头痛越来越严重，让我很苦恼。","去医院咨询一下怎么样？","我们家孩子最近根本不听话，真是个问题。"],"answer":1}]}
